    "title": "See the Oscars red carpet looks",
    "text": "Red Carpet Winners List Analysis The Academy Awards were Sunday night in Hollywood, hosted by Conan O'Brien. One Battle After Another took home best picture, in addition to awards for Paul Thomas Anderson for best director and best adapted screenplay. Sinners star Michael B. Jordan won best actor, and Hamnet's Jessie Buckley won best actress. Read the full list of winners here. Michael B. Jordan Angela Weiss/AFP via Getty Images hide caption toggle caption Angela Weiss/AFP via Getty Images Amy Madigan Arturo Holmes/Getty Images hide caption toggle caption Arturo Holmes/Getty Images Kate Hudson Angela Weiss/AFP via Getty Images hide caption toggle caption Angela Weiss/AFP via Getty Images Wunmi Mosaku Kevin Mazur/Getty Images hide caption toggle caption Kevin Mazur/Getty Images Ethan Hawke Arturo Holmes/Getty Images hide caption toggle caption Arturo Holmes/Getty Images Chloé Zhao Mike Coppola/Getty Images hide caption toggle caption Mike Coppola/Getty Images Emma Stone Angela Weiss/AFP hide caption toggle caption Angela Weiss/AFP Delroy Lindo Matei Horvath/FilmMagic hide caption toggle caption Matei Horvath/FilmMagic Jessie Buckley Mike Coppola/Getty Images hide caption toggle caption Mike Coppola/Getty Images Benicio del Toro Arturo Holmes/Getty Images hide caption toggle caption Arturo Holmes/Getty Images Renate Reinsve Mike Coppola/Getty Images hide caption toggle caption Mike Coppola/Getty Images Leonardo DiCaprio Gilbert Flores/Penske Media hide caption toggle caption Gilbert Flores/Penske Media Inga Ibsdotter Lilleaas Kevin Mazur/Getty Images hide caption toggle caption Kevin Mazur/Getty Images Wagner Moura Arturo Holmes/Getty Images hide caption toggle caption Arturo Holmes/Getty Images Raphael Saadiq Frazer Harrison/WireImage hide caption toggle caption Frazer Harrison/WireImage EJAE Mike Coppola/Getty Images hide caption toggle caption Mike Coppola/Getty Images Timothée Chalamet Gilbert Flores/Penske Media hide caption toggle caption Gilbert Fl